From 8837318d7ce75184982ad03fc64a95a6abafa21d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ilvise <ilvise@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 13:44:58 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add FTP games (d2x cIOS with network support)

Wii games stored as .iso on an FTP server are added to the game list
and played through a d2x cIOS built with FTP support in the DIP plugin
(IOCTL_DI_NET_SET, 0xF8). Anonymous login by default, optional user
and password in the settings file.

- Loader Settings: FTP Games on/off, FTP Server (ip[:port]), FTP Path
- scan of *.iso in the FTP path and one folder level below it
- FTP games use partition FTP_PARTITION, local games take precedence
- SetupDisc() sets the FTP game in the cIOS instead of the fraglist

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_011aRefQk2cuvAVZhYw39bGv
